WEBVTT

00:01:59.174 --> 00:02:02.347
is not typeset on an old typewriter;

00:02:02.371 --> 00:02:03.647
it's on Word.

00:02:03.671 --> 00:02:05.384
Bloggers exposed this,

00:02:05.408 --> 00:02:07.976
or they worked hard to expose this.

00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:10.567
You know, blogs are scary.
This is what you see.

00:02:10.591 --> 00:02:16.064
I see this, and I'm sure scared --
I swear on stage -- shitless about blogs,

00:02:16.088 --> 00:02:19.072
because this is not
something that's friendly.

00:02:19.096 --> 00:02:22.722
But there are blogs that are changing
the way we read news

00:02:22.746 --> 00:02:25.143
and consume media,
and these are great examples.

00:02:25.167 --> 00:02:27.452
These people are reaching thousands,

00:02:27.476 --> 00:02:29.322
if not millions, of readers,

00:02:29.346 --> 00:02:30.976
and that's incredibly important.